# Generated files whose bytes are asserted, so their line endings cannot vary
# by platform.
#
# supabase/apply-modules.sql is extracted from schema.sql by
# scripts/generate-apply-modules.mjs, and check-apply-modules.mjs compares the
# committed file to a freshly generated one byte for byte. With
# core.autocrlf=true and no rule here, git checks the file out as CRLF on
# Windows and LF on Linux CI, so one of the two platforms always saw drift that
# was purely an line-ending artefact -- the gate passed locally and failed on CI.
#
# -text disables all conversion: the bytes in the repo are the bytes on disk,
# everywhere.
supabase/apply-modules.sql -text
graphify-out/graph.json merge=graphify
